-- 044_spinning.sql
-- Two indoor-cycling (spinning) plans filed with cycling, in French, English
-- and German: for beginners in 6 weeks, and HIIT in 8 weeks. Each session
-- holds its blocks (kind, duration, cadence, resistance), which the app plays
-- as a guided session with a timer and beeps.
--
-- Deploy: apply this file, in any order with the code (the app has the plans
-- built in and reads the blocks from them).
--
-- Safe to re-run. All-or-nothing: wrapped in one transaction.

